{
  "id": "dcTelegramBot001",
  "name": "DocChat: Telegram bot",
  "active": false,
  "nodes": [
    {
      "parameters": {
        "content": "## DocChat Telegram bot\nOne bot for every workspace. A chat is linked with `/start <code>` (code from DocChat > Workspace > Chat apps), then questions go to that workspace with a **service key** and the `X-DocChat-Link` header.\n\n- `/new` starts a new conversation, `/unlink` unlinks, `/help`.\n- Files sent in a private chat are added to the workspace; the second trigger tells the chat when they are ready.\n- In groups the bot only answers commands, @mentions and replies.\n\nSetup: see `n8n/README.md`.",
        "width": 500,
        "height": 380
      },
      "id": "fabd37a5-882c-5c13-80ab-ef2caf6e5821",
      "name": "About",
      "type": "n8n-nodes-base.stickyNote",
      "typeVersion": 1,
      "position": [
        -500,
        -320
      ]
    },
    {
